{# The full task CARD — the FIRST message inside a watched issue's thread (nested
   under the issue_root anchor). Posted once, together with the anchor, when the
   topic is first created (eagerly on open, or lazily on a later comment / label
   add). Agreed shape: описание · срок · исполнитель · лейблы. #}
{% if description %}<blockquote>{{ clip_comment(description, url) }}</blockquote>{% else %}📝 <i>без описания</i><br>{% endif %}
{% set shown = display_labels(labels) %}{% if due %}📅 {{ due | ru_date }}{% endif %}{% if assignees %}{% if due %} · {% endif %}👤 {{ mentions(assignees) }}{% endif %}{% if shown %}{% if due or assignees %} · {% endif %}{{ labels_html(shown) }}{% endif %}
